.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Dennison (1926) solved Schrodinger&#x27;s equation for a rotating diatomic molecule, giving levels E_J=J(J+1)\hbar^2/2I. Builds an HCl-like RigidRotor from its atomic masses and bond length (~chemistrykit.quantum.systems.rigid_rotor.RigidRotor.from_diatomic), plots its energy-level diagram (each level&#x27;s height showing its (2J+1)-fold degeneracy), and shows that the J\to J+1 microwave absorption lines are evenly spaced by 2B.">

